00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.590
<b>Shungo!</b>

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.880
<b>I want to eat ramen.</b>

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.220
<b>Why?</b>

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:23.550
<b>It doesn't matter why. I want to eat it because I want to eat it.</b>

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:26.560
<b>If you understand then prepare it immediately!</b>

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:27.850
<b>Got it?!</b>

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.100
<b>Ramen, eh?</b>

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.150
<b>What's the matter, Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:40.650
<b>Nah, it's just that Nee-san{Sis} wants me to make some ramen for her.</b>

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.030
<b>Ramen?</b>

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.780
<b>Here, take this.</b>

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:50.200
<b>Ah, sorry. That probably wouldn't work.</b>

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.330
<b>Nee-san{Sis} is really fussy when it comes to food.</b>

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:56.960
<b>Is that so? But, it's really good.</b>

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.840
<b>No, I'm really sorry.</b>

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:04.050
<b>Actually, where did you get that? I don't remember buying that.</b>

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:04.930
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.050
<b>There are heaps of them in the pantry below.</b>

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:14.140
<b>Well, nevermind. Anyways, I need to make some ramen that will satisfy my Nee-san{sister}.</b>

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:16.900
<b>In that case.</b>

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.690
<b>Here, use this please.</b>

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:21.030
<b>What's this?</b>

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:25.530
<b>You can use this for ramen delivery. How's that?</b>

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.780
<b>No, I really don't think that would work.</b>

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:33.000
<b>Nee-san{Sis} will never be able to accept that.</b>

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.290
<b>It won't work?</b>

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.920
<b>This is probably a written challenge from her.</b>

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:42.880
<b>One which says, "Create a ramen that will satisfy me."</b>

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.130
<b>I see, a written challenge.</b>

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:49.510
<b>In that case, cup ramen will never work.</b>

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:54.270
<b>But I'm really at odds and ends.
When I am told to make ramen so suddenly?</b>

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.440
<b>Hey, Shungo! Is the ramen ready yet?</b>

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.820
<b>Sorry, wait a while longer!</b>

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.730
<b>Stop taking your time!</b>

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.990
<b>I guess we should start preparing it quickly.</b>

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:15.290
<b>Yeah. But how can I make a ramen that Nee-san{Sis} will accept?</b>

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.500
<b>Anyways, let's see what we can use as ingredients.</b>

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.840
<b>But, there are so many different types of ramen.</b>

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:33.970
<b>Like soy sauce flavour, or miso flavour.</b>

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:38.900
<b>And, there are so many variations of accompaniments to put in.</b>

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:42.400
<b>Like tonkotsu style, or minced chicken style.</b>

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:45.820
<b>If I don't mix them correctly...</b>

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:50.530
<b>If only Houjou-senpai was available at a critical time like this.</b>

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:57.750
<b>She's the type of person capable of anything, so she could have given me some good ideas.</b>

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.040
<b>Well, so much for that.</b>

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.460
<b>Since she said that she'd be busy with company work.</b>

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:09.050
<b>Ninomiya-kun, Ninomiya-kun!
Can you come here for a moment?</b>

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:13.050
<b>After doing some research,
I think this one is really popular.</b>

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:15.020
<b>Hm, let me see.</b>

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.940
<b>Hm! I see.</b>

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.110
<b>Sorry, give me a sec.</b>

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:31.870
<b>I see.</b>

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.210
<b>This might just work.</b>

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.330
<b>Tsukimura-san, will you lend me a hand?</b>

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.210
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:49.800
<b>All right!</b>

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:57.640
<b>Ah, Tsukimura-san, don't cut up the vegetables.</b>

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.140
<b>Put them in whole like this.</b>

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:12.110
<b>It's starting to really look like ramen soup.</b>

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:15.490
<b>It's got a great aroma too.</b>

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.580
<b>Yeah, that's right...</b>

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.410
<b>It's certainly not bad. Not bad, but...</b>

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.370
<b>But is this enough?</b>

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:26.790
<b>Will that Nee-san{sister} of mine really accept this?</b>

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:31.760
<b>Shungo! Hey, Shungo! How long do you plan on making me wait?</b>

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.140
<b>Sorry, it's being prepared as we speak.</b>

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.760
<b>Just wait a while longer.</b>

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.600
<b>If you bring me tasteless ramen
after making me wait so long, then...</b>

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.480
<b>you understand what's in store for you, right?</b>

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.480
<b>Of course. You won't be disappointed.</b>

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:52.610
<b>This is bad. The difficulty has just gone up.</b>

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:59.740
<b>I could make something extravagant for her,
but merely making unconventional ramen won't work.</b>

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:05.210
<b>If only Houjou-senpai was with me now.</b>

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.300
<b>Ninomiya-kun, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:15.470
<b>This was the site with the recipe earlier, but...</b>

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.140
<b>take a look at this.</b>

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.760
<b>There's a hidden page. See?</b>

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.890
<b>The way to make the ultimate ramen?</b>

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:30.230
<b>I see. So, it just isn't about the soup.
The noodles themselves have to be scrutinised.</b>

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:32.740
<b>And the char siew is important too.</b>

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:37.200
<b>Don't just put in the tonkotsu but also add seafood.</b>

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.910
<b>Okay, the places to obtain the ingredients are clearly stated as well.</b>

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:45.120
<b>So, I'll go get them right away.</b>

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.170
<b>Tsukimura-san, can you watch over the pot while I'm gone?</b>

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.880
<b>Watch over the pot?</b>

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:56.470
<b>That's right. The soup needs constant attention, and must be constantly stirred.</b>

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:59.890
<b>It's an important task, but can you do it for me?</b>

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:03.600
<b>Sure, just leave it to me.</b>

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:07.350
<b>Thank you. Then, I'll get going right away.</b>

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:09.150
<b>Have a safe trip.</b>

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:12.150
<b>All right, I've gotta give it my all.</b>

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.810
<b>So hot!</b>

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.530
<b>This is harder than I thought.</b>

00:09:56.530 --> 00:10:00.740
<b>But this is a job Ninomiya-kun entrusted to me.</b>

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.280
<b>I have to give it my all.</b>

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.790
<b>Doing this by myself is really hard.</b>

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.880
<b>At times like these...</b>

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:41.450
<b>Howdy, good work getting here.</b>

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.490
<b>Why are you here, Mikihiko-san?</b>

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:48.000
<b>This is my kitchen garden.</b>

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.170
<b>By the way, what's your purpose in coming here?</b>

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:56.460
<b>Actually, I heard that I could get wheat here to produce the ultimate noodles.</b>

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.510
<b>Ah, then come this way.</b>

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:03.640
<b>You can sift through the lot and pick whatever you like.</b>

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.020
<b>Sift through?</b>

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:10.180
<b>You have to sift through this and pick out the finest grain from here.</b>

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:12.020
<b>Here, for example...</b>

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:15.940
<b>This one is pretty good.</b>

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:20.030
<b>I can't tell this one apart from the rest of the wheat.</b>

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:24.780
<b>Well, good luck. The sun will set if you don't hurry.</b>

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.590
<b>It's so hot!</b>

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:41.300
<b>What the hell is this? It's really unbelievable.</b>

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:46.430
<b>Forgive me, Hinako-san, I asked for your help despite you being busy.</b>

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.510
<b>Seriously!</b>

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:52.430
<b>I was busy with the preparations for the field trip.</b>

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:55.440
<b>But this is suffocatingly hot.</b>

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.650
<b>I can't wear clothes in this heat.</b>

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.990
<b>You mustn't, Hinako-san. It's unladylike.</b>

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.530
<b>Wha-? It's not a problem, right?</b>

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.700
<b>There are only us girls here.</b>

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:11.950
<b>But, you have to be a little more refined, and more modest.</b>

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:13.660
<b>It's better that way.</b>

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:17.130
<b>Very well, how's this then?</b>

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.810
<b>I feel something's wrong about that.</b>

