<b>Aren't the proportions perfect?</b>

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.900
<b>Really?</b>

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.570
<b>I wonder about that...</b>

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.820
<b>By the way, you'll be wearing this too.</b>

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:48.450
<b>Why?</b>

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:53.830
<b>That's because if you don't wear cool clothing, you'll be drained and be unable to work.</b>

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:55.920
<b>Come, come!</b>

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:02.050
<b>Then, I'll go change into something more cooling.</b>

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.670
<b>That's good enough, right?</b>

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.670
<b>Nope.</b>

00:13:04.670 --> 00:13:06.300
<b>Why?</b>

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:09.180
<b>Because it won't be any fun for me.</b>

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.430
<b>That's your true intention, isn't it?</b>

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:13.270
<b>Oh, shut up!</b>

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.060
<b>Change into this now!</b>

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.440
<b>No!</b>

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.440
<b>Hey! Wait!</b>

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.900
<b>Stop!</b>

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.280
<b>Howdy, good work getting here.</b>

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:30.410
<b>Will the jokes ever end?</b>

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:40.920
<b>Mikihiko Farm</b>

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:40.920
<b>Mikihiko Farm</b>

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:35.290
<b>Really? By the way, what do you need from my private farm?</b>

