the pork to make the ultimate char siew here.</b>

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:43.670
<b>In that case, will this pig do?</b>

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.170
<b>This is a pig?!</b>

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:49.890
<b>This is what you call the ultimate pork.</b>

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:52.220
<b>So, will this do?</b>

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.890
<b>No, no, no...</b>

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:04.610
<b>If you can defeat him, then you can take all the meat you want back.</b>

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.780
<b>Good luck!</b>

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.530
<b>Damnit! Doesn't leave me much choice but to do it!</b>

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:19.250
<b>So this is Shungo-han's house?</b>

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.330
