00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:46.210
<b>I heard that I could obtain the dried tuna stock to make the ultimate seafood soup here.</b>

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:49.840
<b>Step right up. I'll take you to the fishing grounds.</b>

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:58.890
<b>Many men have lost their lives to the seas here.</b>

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.180
<b>Please take the proper precautions.</b>

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:05.900
<b>Ahh, so there are giant man-eaters living here?</b>

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:08.650
<b>Exactly. You know your stuff.</b>

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.820
<b>See, you've caught one, just as you were talking about it.</b>

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.780
<b>Damnit!</b>

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.870
<b>You...</b>

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.500
<b>Woah, nice tuna!</b>

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.010
<b>Hmph, what a great social position.</b>

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:38.850
<b>Well, whatever. I'll just have to do the work given to me.</b>

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:44.890
<b>Ojou-sama instructed me to prepare the shipping for her new product.</b>

00:16:44.890 --> 00:16:48.020
<b>It's a project Ojou-sama drafted by herself.</b>

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.820
<b>I hope it goes well.</b>

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:56.280
<b>Somehow, this is suddenly getting really fun.</b>

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:58.700
<b>Ain't it?</b>

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:04.160
<b>After thinking about it again, I really feel that these clothes are adorable.</b>

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:05.500
<b>Right?</b>

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:11.710
<b>What are you girls doing?</b>

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.220
<b>You saw us, didn't you?</b>

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.370
<b>Ojou-sama!</b>

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.330
<b>Don't be silly, Shinobu-chan.</b>

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.960
<b>Don't be hurt by something as small as that.</b>

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:53.250
<b>But lately, Ojou-sama has been so cold to me.</b>

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:58.970
<b>Hinako will get mad if you keep on worrying like that. pun, pun!</b>

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:10.480
<b>Even so, this is so hard and thick and so strong.</b>

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:13.860
<b>I'm starting to feel a little strange.</b>

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.230
<b>You shouldn't think dirty thoughts.</b>

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:18.700
<b>Tsukimura, please take caution.</b>

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:21.280
<b>But, it's not my fault.</b>

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:25.950
<b>Because this really is hard and thick and really strong.</b>

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.250
<b>Don't be beaten by impure thoughts.</b>

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.960
<b>Tsukimura, please be more cautious.</b>

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.210
<b>Please be cautious.</b>

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.340
<b>I'm back, Tsukimura-san!</b>

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.430
<b>I've got the ingredients...</b>

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.220
<b>here...</b>

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.470
<b>What the hell?</b>

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:48.940
<b>Welcome back, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.020
<b>The soup is boiled to perfection.</b>

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:59.240
<b>All you need to do is apply the finishing touches.</b>

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:02.610
<b>Very well!</b>

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:04.530
<b>The table is set.</b>

00:19:04.530 --> 00:19:07.040
<b>This is the final spurt.</b>

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.670
<b>Do your best!</b>

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.100
<b>Amazing!</b>

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:51.870
<b>It's done!</b>

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.960
<b>Hurray!{Yatta!}</b>

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:58.760
<b>Okay, we have to bring this to my Nee-san{sister} right away!</b>

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.970
<b>Nee-san{Sis}! It's ready!</b>

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.470
<b>This is my ultimate creation!</b>

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.190
<b>How is it?</b>

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.740
<b>How's the taste of my company's latest production?</b>

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:27.320
<b>I see. So it's dried with the oil, then returned to its original state with boiling water?</b>

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:30.450
<b>It may be cheap, but it's a bold concept-food.</b>

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.500
<b>Haven't you ever heard of cup ramen before?</b>

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.500
<b>Cup ramen?</b>

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.500
<b>What's that?</b>

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.250
<b>Well, in any case, I'm glad you let me try something interesting.</b>

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:43.340
<b>I'm satisfied, thanks for the meal.</b>

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.800
<b>It's nothing great.</b>

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.840
<b>So, we basically get your seal of approval then?</b>

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:50.720
<b>I've got to get this mass produced immediately.</b>

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:57.610
<b>Ah, sorry. I'm already full.</b>

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.490
<b>Look closely.</b>

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:10.580
<b>Witness this chapter in my life where
I move up another rung in my brilliant career.</b>

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:17.500
<b>Witness this chapter in my life where
I move up another rung in my brilliant career.</b>

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:21.000
<b>There's no way you could dislike the taste.</b>

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:26.470
<b>After all, I wanted to develop something with my own abilities, and also...</b>

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.720
<b>this was an experiment to nurture a profitable business.</b>

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.810
<b>And it was a great success.</b>

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:37.230
<b>I'm frightened by my own talent.</b>

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:44.030
<b>So, what do you say? If you insist, I don't mind
giving you guys a special chance to sample some.</b>

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:46.030
<b>Wai- Wait, what's the matter?</b>

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:47.780
<b>What is it?</b>

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.240
<b>Hojou-senpai, you...</b>

